<title>JORDAN: Jordanian sentenced to life for killing Israelis.</title>
<headline>Jordanian sentenced to life for killing Israelis.</headline>
<dateline>MARJ AL-HAMAM, Jordan 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A military court in Jordan sentenced a soldier to life imprisonment with hard labour on Saturday for killing seven Israeli schoolgirls in March.</p>
<p>The five-man panel of military judges said the soldier, Ahmed Daqamsa, was guilty of murder but said his crime was not premeditated.</p>
</text>
